  culture: `<p>Storytelling (<i>7awadiit</i>) is a social art in Egypt. A good storyteller acts out voices, swears (<i>wallaahi!</i>) at every twist, and gets constant feedback: <i>la2!</i>, <i>bithazzar!</i>, <i>w ba3deen?</i> (“and then?”). As a listener, react out loud; silence sounds like boredom.</p>`,
