  lesson: [
    { h: "inn: that", p: `<b>inn</b> introduces a clause: <i>a3ta2id inn…</i> “I think that…”. With pronouns it takes object endings: <i>innu</i> that he, <i>inn-aha</i> that she, <i>inni</i> that I, <i>innak</i> that you, <i>innuhum</i> that they.`,
      ex: [["أعتقد إن الفكرة كويسة", "a3ta2id inn il-fikra kwayyisa", "I think the idea is good"], ["حاسس إنه زعلان", "7aasis innu za3laan", "I feel that he's upset"], ["متأكدة إنها جاية", "mit2akkida innaha gayya", "I'm sure she's coming"], ["سمعت إنك مسافر", "simi3t innak msaafir", "I heard you're travelling"]] },
    { h: "Giving your view", p: `<i>fi ra2yi</i> in my opinion, <i>a3ta2id / azunn</i> I think (formal), <i>biyithayya2li</i> it seems to me, <i>7aasis inn</i> I feel that, <i>ana shaayif inn</i> I see it that…, <i>il-7a2ii2a</i> honestly / in fact.` },
    { h: "Agreeing and disagreeing", p: `Agree: <i>3andak 7a22</i> you're right (<i>3andik 7a22</i> f), <i>bizzabt</i> exactly, <i>ana ma3aak</i> I'm with you. Disagree softly: <i>ana mish mit2akkid</i> I'm not sure, <i>mumkin, bass…</i> maybe, but…, <i>ana shaayif 3aks kida</i> I see it the other way.` },
  ],
  dialogue: { title: "Cairo or the coast?", lines: [
    ["Heba", "إيه رأيك في فكرة إننا نعيش في الساحل بدل القاهرة؟", "eh ra2yak fi fikrit inn-ina ni3iish fis-saa7il badal il-2aahira?", "What do you think of the idea of us living on the coast instead of Cairo?"],
    ["Waleed", "بصراحة، أنا شايف إن القاهرة أحسن للشغل.", "bi-saraa7a, ana shaayif inn il-2aahira a7san lish-shughl.", "Honestly, I think Cairo is better for work."],
    ["Heba", "عندك حق، بس الزحمة والدوشة هنا بتتعبني.", "3andak 7a22, bass iz-za7ma w id-dawsha hina bit-ta3abni.", "You're right, but the traffic and noise here wear me out."],
    ["Waleed", "أنا فاهم، بس في الساحل مفيش حاجة تعملها في الشتا.", "ana faahim, bass fis-saa7il mafiish 7aaga ti3milha fish-shita.", "I understand, but on the coast there's nothing to do in winter."],
    ["Heba", "ممكن، بس أعتقد إن الهدوء ده هو اللي إحنا محتاجينه.", "mumkin, bass a3ta2id inn il-huduu2 da huwwa lli i7na m7tagiinu.", "Maybe, but I think that peace is exactly what we need."],
    ["Waleed", "طيب، إيه رأيك نجرب شهر في الصيف الأول ونشوف؟", "tayyib, eh ra2yik nigarrab shahr fis-seef il-awwil w nshuuf?", "OK, how about we try a month in summer first and see?"],
    ["Heba", "فكرة حلوة. اتفقنا.", "fikra 7ilwa. ittafa2na.", "Good idea. Deal."],
  ] },
